<title>UK: UK's Britannia raises mortgage rate to 7.99 pct.</title>
<headline>UK's Britannia raises mortgage rate to 7.99 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Britannia Building Society said on Monday it had raised its standard variable mortgage rate by 39 basis points to 7.99 percent.</p>
<p>Mutually-owned Britannia said it was raising its mortgage rate in response to similar moves by competitors after the Bank of England raised interest rates earlier this month. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
